  "note": "Implementation pass (2026-11-01, taneishakaur with Claude): 64 active VEN-IMPACT ids (PRIMARY, approval pending) for AC1 to AC9 as reworded in Jira on 1 Nov 2026. Confluence matrix and case pages VEN-IMPACT-01 to 09 under folder 21529124 (case folder 21037711). Retired: VEN-IMPACT-02-B and 02-C (manual cases of 7 Oct 2026 when AC2 also held the blocking and boundary rules; replaced by 03-A and 04-A). Shared test files use titleMatch ^VEN-IMPACT- so the SPM-121, SPM-122, SPM-77 and other tests in them are not in scope. Decisions SC-SPM125-01 to 04. Revised 2 Nov 2026 (SC-SPM125-01): the Venue Staff bell and summary notice were removed; VEN-IMPACT-06-E to 06-I, 06-SEC-1 and 07-F are retired, and ASSIGN-NOTIFY-01-E is unchanged. Changed earlier tests: the SPM-122 service and repository tests that now pass the Venue Staff member, and the reject spec's Coordinator type list. Rebased on dev a983cd93 (2 Nov 2026) after SPM-137 merged: the schema moved to migration/init 030 and reuses SPM-137's notifications.related_booking_id (029); the notices open SPM-137's /bookings?booking=<id> details dialog, which now offers Find a replacement venue for an affected booking (VEN-IMPACT-07-C, 07-D and 07-BND-1 rewritten). PR #98 review (2 Nov 2026): reassignment now also marks the previous Coordinator's unread venue-change notices read (SC-SPM125-05, VEN-IMPACT-07-H) and capacity notices skip rows that no longer hold the venue (SC-SPM125-03 amended, VEN-IMPACT-09-BND-3). No mutants file yet: mutation testing is left for Test Code Review.",
